# eCommerce Brands – Niche Landing Page

## 1. Niche Overview & Positioning

This niche covers small and mid-sized eCommerce brands selling directly to consumers through
their own online stores. Revenue depends on turning traffic into first-time orders and turning first-
time orders into repeat customers.

Many teams are lean and spend most of their energy on product, marketing and fulfilment. Cart
abandonment, low repeat purchase rates and a constant stream of support enquiries quietly erode
margin. Automation offers a way to recover revenue from abandoned carts, improve customer
communication and nudge more customers back to buy again.

